            <div xml:id="d533">

                <pb facs="0633" n="545" sameAs="frus:frus1933v05/pg545"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">837.00/4558: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Personal Representative of the President</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Caffery</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                            State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-12-26T17:00:00-05:00">December 26, 1933—5
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 6 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>530. I am endeavoring to explore situation thoroughly and hope to have some
                    definite suggestions to make next week.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Caffery</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
